#: ninefruits/person/actions/merge.py
msgid "Both people have instructor records. Merge the instructor records first."
msgstr "दुवै व्यक्तिको प्राध्यापक अभिलेख छ। पहिले प्राध्यापक अभिलेखहरू गाभ्नुहोस्।"

